::MCR_U02_L06_Quiz_Q01::
Question ID: MCR_U02_L06_Quiz_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.MCR.AR.8
Question:
A fee is  up to 2 pounds and  over 2 pounds. Which cost applies to exactly 2 pounds?
{
=A. $6#Correct. Up to includes the boundary value.
~B. $10#This is for values over the boundary, not exactly at it.
~C. $16#This adds both rules instead of choosing one interval.
~D. $4#This subtracts the fees and does not match either rule.
}
::MCR_U02_L06_Quiz_Q02::
Question ID: MCR_U02_L06_Quiz_Q02
MLA Standard: MLA.MCR.AR.8
Question:
A fee is  up to 3 pounds and  over 3 pounds. Which cost applies to exactly 3 pounds?
{
~A. $10#This would apply only when the input is over the boundary.
=B. $6#Correct. Up to includes the boundary value.
~C. $4#This subtracts the fees and does not match either rule.
~D. $0#This ignores the stated fee rule.
}
